OL,3,GNEWSALFB named in Met's evidence file
OL,4,Aon Grenfell fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FLondon Fire Brigade (LFB) and a
OL,7,Ftenants' association have confirmed
OL,8,Fthey are among those facing possible
OL,9,Fcriminal action over the Grenfell Tower
OL,10,Ffire.
OL,12,FProsecutors were handed an evidence
OL,13,Ffile on 20 organisations and firms and
OL,14,F54 individuals from the Metropolitan
OL,15,FPolice earlier this week.
OL,17,FLFB and Kensington and Chelsea Tenant
OL,18,FManagement Organisation (KCTMO) have
OL,19,Fbeen criticised for failings relating
OL,20,Fto the fire and will find out next year
OL,21,Fif they will be prosecuted.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
