OL,3,GNEWSALFB named in Met's evidence file
OL,4,Aon Grenfell fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Met is seeking charges including
OL,7,Fcorporate manslaughter, gross
OL,8,Fnegligence manslaughter, health and
OL,9,Fsafety offences and fraud offences over
OL,10,Fthe deaths of 72 people in the 2017
OL,11,Fdisaster.
